# Splat Lab's splats' bindings for `coax wgsl apps/openagents-web/gpu/splatlab-fx.coax` (coax/web/wgsl-module.coax):
# NAME GROUP BINDING, and `uniform COUNT` for a []f32 read as a uniform block of COUNT vec4fs.
# They are coax/web/host.js's particle layouts with sorting: group 0 splatlab.wgsl's uniforms, read
# up to the emitters' end (256 floats, 64 vec4fs); group 1 the static splats and the sorted order;
# group 2 a sort pass's step (k, j, width, count) and the texture the step before it wrote.
u 0 0 uniform 64
splats 1 0
order 1 1
sp 2 0 uniform 1
prev 2 1
